{"Missing double-check after acquiring write lock can overwrite a valid cache with a failed result - between releasing the read lock and acquiring the write lock, another goroutine could have populated entryPointAssetsCache, but the code does not re-check the cache after acquiring the write lock, causing it to recompute and unconditionally overwrite the cache": 0.8708359599113464, "HTTP call to CDN uses http.DefaultClient without explicit timeout/context handling - http.DefaultClient has no timeout set, so a slow or unresponsive CDN could cause the request to hang indefinitely": 0.35353192687034607}